{"text": "October 1, 1974\n\nMiss Susan E. Holt\n\nRe: SALEM EXTRA \"WATERDROPS\" AND \"ICE CUBES\" OT\n\nThis is to request an Outdoor Test on the two Salem Extra out-of-\nhome executions referred to as \"Waterdrops\" and \"Ice Cubes\".\n\nThe purpose of this testing is to measure the communicative efficacy\nof out-of-home executions developed for Salem Extra. Results will\nbe used in the total evaluation of the Salem Extra campaign and in\n\nthe determination of what modifications, if any, are required should\nthe brand be expanded to national distribution.\n\ntwo outdoor executions will be used in both New Orleans and Birmingham.\nCopy will stress, first of all, the new brand ~ Salem Extra. The copy\nJine will read \"Extra Cool, Salem Smooth\" on both executions.\nRavertising will be directed toward the 18-34 young adult, blue\ncollar males (or simply, \"the Kool franchise\"). The first execution\n\u201cWaterdrops\" will appear October 15, 1974 in both New Orleans and\nBirmingham with the second execution \"Ice Cubes\" appearing November\n15, 1974, also both,in New Orleans and Birmingham.\n\nThis is a non-budgeted test. However, the test can be covered from\nother sources within the 1974 approved Salem Extra budget.\n\nMargar\u00e9t A. Daniel\nMarketing Research Department\n\nMAD: aw\ncc: Miss Ellen Monahan\n\nMr. L. W. Hall, dr.\nMr. R. M. Powers\n\n6SLL z\u00a5I0S", "words": [{"text": "October", "x0": 324, "y0": 160, "x1": 386, "y1": 171, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "1,", "x0": 397, "y0": 159, "x1": 411, "y1": 172, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1974", "x0": 424, "y0": 158, "x1": 456, "y1": 169, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Miss", "x0": 73, "y0": 226, "x1": 107, "y1": 237, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Susan", "x0": 117, "y0": 227, "x1": 159, "y1": 237, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "E.", "x0": 168, "y0": 226, "x1": 182, "y1": 236, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "Holt", "x0": 194, "y0": 225, "x1": 229, "y1": 235, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "Re:", "x0": 74, "y0": 259, "x1": 97, "y1": 268, "conf":